msgid "Survival subject and analysis-time quantities are derived from the accrual assumptions. Fixed-design values use the corresponding fixed-design survival calculation; maximum/final values use the group sequential design. Event information is summarized in the main design table and look schedule."
msgstr ""
"تُشتق أعداد الأفراد ومقادير زمن التحليل للبقاء من افتراضات ضم المشاركين. "
